OL,3,GNEWSAAbuse victims may lose trust,
OL,4,Aimmunity case told
OL,5,
OL,6,FConfidence in police and prosecutors
OL,7,Fmay weaken if they are immune from
OL,8,Fbeing sued for wrongly sharing domestic
OL,9,Fabuse victims' sensitive details in
OL,10,Fcourt, the Supreme Court has heard.
OL,12,FIt comes after a woman, known as 'XGY',
OL,13,Fescaped an abusive ex in 2019, only to
OL,14,Fhave her new address disclosed to him
OL,15,Fby a barrister in court, forcing her to
OL,16,Fmove again.
OL,18,FShe sued Sussex Police and the CPS,
OL,19,Fclaiming it made her homeless and
OL,20,Faffected her mental health.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
