OL,3,GNEWSAAbuse victims may lose trust,
OL,4,Aimmunity case told
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, her claim was dismissed in
OL,7,Fboth County Court and the Court of
OL,8,FAppeal, prompting concerns from
OL,9,Fcampaigners about the potential impact
OL,10,Fon victims' rights and a lack of
OL,11,Faccountability for police.
